      "position_basis": "ECEF geocentric metres converted to geodetic on the WGS 84 ellipsoid (a=6378137.0 m, 1/f=298.257223563) by the closed-form Bowring/Ferrari solution. Ed B names the datum itself: \"WGS 84 ECEF coordinates\"",
